
Text: "The Mathlingua Reference describes the language and `mlg` tool as they are
implemented today. It covers collection structure, formulation and structural
syntax, headings, semantic checking, rendering, and command-line workflows.
Examples marked `mlg` are checked as source; examples marked `mlg-fragment` are
illustrative fragments."
